## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design secure, scalable multi-tenant inference with cross-account PrivateLink, model registry usage, and drift-aware rollouts under cost constraints.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Model Registry and Pipelines
- PrivateLink across AWS accounts
- Multi-tenant isolation strategies (shared vs. per-tenant containers)
- Drift detection with SageMaker Clarify
- Canary rollout and rollback strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
function routeTenant(input, modelRegistry) {
  const tenant = input.tenantId;
  if (!allowedTenants.has(tenant)) {
    throw new Error('Unauthorized tenant');
  }
  const modelVersion = modelRegistry.getModelVersion(tenant, 'latest');
  return invokeSageMaker(modelVersion.endpoint, input);
}
```
